    "directions": [
      "Season your shrimp with curry powder, salt, black pepper and ginger then marinate for a few minutes.",
      "Now in a large frying pan add some vegetable oil on a medium heat then add onions, garlic then cook down until soft.",
      "Add Turmeric paste then stir in and add coconut milk then mix together to create a coconut sauce.",
      "Add shrimp then stir and cook for a few minutes then add bell peppers and spring onions stir together then add scotch bonnet pepper and cook for 5 minutes on a Low heat.",
      "Serve with white rice. Garnish with dried thyme."
    ],
